# Language Test 202505 - ABC244C: Yamanote Line Game
Sonome kas N tas Kisite kas readint.
Sonome kas mine tas N + 1.
Takute kas mine.
Kisite kas flush.
Sonome kas reply tas 0.
Pilike kas turn pas Kisite kas pilika vis N {
    Kemese kas reply tas Kisite kas readint.
    Palusta reply kate 0 {
        Kinise.
    }
    Kemese kas mine tas 2 * N + 2 - reply.
    Takute kas mine.
    Kisite kas flush.
}
